00:57:51.498 --> 00:57:53.709
- The Ku Klux Klan?

00:57:53.709 --> 00:57:55.709
Are you outside of your mind?

00:57:55.709 --> 00:57:58.237
That's traditional country
music imagery, man.

00:57:58.237 --> 00:58:01.044
Like a pickup truck or
sleeping under the stars

00:58:01.044 --> 00:58:03.765
or your dog got killed or your
wife left you, same thing.

00:58:03.765 --> 00:58:06.184
- I would have been fine
with any of those things.

00:58:06.184 --> 00:58:07.392
- What is the difference
between those things

00:58:07.392 --> 00:58:08.701
and what is in the song?

00:58:08.701 --> 00:58:10.111
- They're not racial.

00:58:10.111 --> 00:58:10.944
- Hey, you know what?

00:58:10.944 --> 00:58:11.777
Can I just say something, man?

00:58:11.777 --> 00:58:13.560
I'm just going to be frank.

00:58:13.560 --> 00:58:15.980
You're getting a little like Al Sharpton,

00:58:15.980 --> 00:58:18.201
like Farhan Khan on me right now, man.

00:58:18.201 --> 00:58:20.401
- Oh my God, are you serious?

00:58:20.401 --> 00:58:22.951
- Dude, please, hey, give
me, can I do one more?

00:58:22.951 --> 00:58:24.469
Let me just do one more, dawg.

00:58:24.469 --> 00:58:28.928
I absolutely promise you
that this song is not racist

00:58:28.928 --> 00:58:33.928
and it's impossible for you
to misinterpret it as such.

00:58:33.929 --> 00:58:35.961
- Okay, it seems like you're about to sing

00:58:35.961 --> 00:58:39.211
the most racist song so far.
- I'm not.

00:58:41.436 --> 00:58:43.455
♪ Hidey-Lidey-Lidey-Lee ♪

00:58:43.455 --> 00:58:46.154
♪ Give me a rope and find me a tree ♪

00:58:46.154 --> 00:58:47.487
- Okay, I'm out.

00:58:49.087 --> 00:58:50.664
- Come on, man, hey.

00:58:50.664 --> 00:58:55.664
Shoot, over here, trying
to sing about a tire swing.

00:58:55.691 --> 00:58:59.393
Write off an entire genre of music.

00:58:59.393 --> 00:59:03.215
♪ The banjos are strumming
and the drums are a-banging ♪

00:59:03.215 --> 00:59:06.895
♪ Let's get the boys together
and have ourselves a hangin' ♪

00:59:06.895 --> 00:59:08.812
Oh, damn, now I see it.

00:59:11.639 --> 00:59:13.272
Now I see it.

00:59:13.272 --> 00:59:15.855
(upbeat music)

00:59:18.967 --> 00:59:20.933
♪ I want you ♪

00:59:20.933 --> 00:59:23.107
♪ But I don't need you ♪

